# 大体积二进制：笔记只引用路径，文件本身留在本地
# 注意：原来的 `.pdf`（无通配符）只匹配文件名恰好叫 .pdf 的文件，等于没生效
*.pdf
*.epub
*.mobi
*.azw3
*.djvu
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.dmg
*.exe
*.msi
*.psd
*.ai

# 本地缓存与回收站
**/.trash/
**/.smart-env/
**/copilot-index/

# Private vault content (matches v4 behavior)
**/80-PRIVATE/**/*

# Obsidian Copilot plugin cache
**/.obsidian/plugins/copilot/*

# Local plugin build artifacts
custom/*/dist/
